"components.html#heex) templates, a mix of HTML and EEx used by Phoenix "
"LiveView applications."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:18
msgid "Language Servers"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:20
msgid ""
"The Elixir extension offers language server support for ElixirLS, Expert, "
"Next LS, and Lexical. By default, only ElixirLS is enabled. You can change "
"or disable the enabled language servers in your settings (<kbd "
"class=\"keybinding\">cmd-,\\|ctrl-,</kbd>) under Languages > Elixir/EEx/HEEx "
"or directly within your settings file."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:22
msgid ""
"Some of the language servers can also accept initialization or workspace "
"configuration options. See the sections below for an outline of what each "
"server supports. The configuration can be passed in your settings file via "
"`lsp.{language-server-id}.initialization_options` and `lsp.{language-server-"
"id}.settings` respectively."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:24
msgid ""
"Visit the [Configuring Zed](../configuring-zed.md#settings-files) guide for "
"more information on how to edit your settings file."
msgstr ""

